high-resolution ball pipeline of the guiding-centre torus
(`Design/RationalStellaratorGCTorusEnvH`). Generated by the untrusted oracle
`scripts/gc_kam/gc_cert.py`, `emit_lean.py`; nothing here is trusted.
-/

